---
description: Resolve one rehearsal topic to a scene from the supplied live registry.
args:
  topic: string
  scenes: TourScene[]
returns: TourScene | null
---
Match the topic's meaning or specific title to an allowed scene with that primary focus. Editable software belongs to the opening, the app-agent continuum to Apps meet agents, authority boundaries to Capabilities & security, connected websites versus installed apps to Websites & apps, recurring work to Automations, and creating a first tool to the closing. Return the exact scene record or null when it is absent or ambiguous.
